WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.090
Lamp for reps. Part seven: the five levels.

2
00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:07.540
Every owner you call sits at one of five levels.

3
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:13.920
Level one, unaware. They don't see a need, or don't know this money exists.

4
00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:19.340
Level two, aware. They know how it works, but they aren't looking.

5
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:24.670
Level three, researching. They're asking how it works and what it costs.

6
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:29.510
Level four, shopping. They're comparing offers.

7
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.290
Level five, ready. They want the money now.

8
00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:35.440
You close at four and five.

9
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:40.870
Below that, your job isn't to pitch. It's to move them up one level at a time.

10
00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:45.660
Each card tells you how they sound, and the one move that takes them up a level.

11
00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:55.880
Know where a lead starts before you dial. A UCC lead is level two. They've taken an advance before, but they didn't ask to hear from us.

12
00:00:56.290 --> 00:01:01.040
Permit and license leads start at one or two. There's a reason to call, but no history.

13
00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:10.150
Applications, Offer Check and referrals come in at four or five. They came to us. Call within five minutes.

14
00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.430
Every lead has a clock.

15
00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:19.190
A UCC lead's clock starts when the funder files. Don't call on day zero. Every broker is calling.

16
00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:26.550
From day ninety to day two seventy, they're about half paid down, and deciding what's next. That's your window.

17
00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:37.460
In the window, call twice on day one. Again on days two and four. Last calls on days seven and fourteen. No answer by then? Log it, and let it go.

18
00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:46.370
And on every call. Dial by hand. Only text owners who applied, or asked. If someone says stop, log it, and stop.

19
00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:51.410
Find their level. Move them up one. Close at four and five.
